  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "是雨iah是歷史ê目屎"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span><b>Jī Hiann</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">靜靜仔看　藝術ê解放</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">恬恬仔聽　囥tī心內悲傷鬱卒ê聲</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄免理由　安插罪名</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">禁閉　不見天日</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風無聲　水無流　食無味　鼻無臭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">求天不靈　huah地bē應</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">刑求　是身疼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Jiàu耙仔　是心疼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">起訴　是人iah是鬼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐个lóng惡tshǹg-tshǹg</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親tsiânn　朋友　lim茶　開講</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無koh再tńg--來</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">消失　sù常ê代誌</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無人敢出聲</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看有--ê是青面giàng牙</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看無--ê是hōo人驚惶tám-tám ê白色惡鬼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人性ê扭曲　懷疑</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無證據　就是證據</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">借戒嚴之名　屠殺無辜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吐一口khuì　沓沓仔　沓沓仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拖沉重ê跤步</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細細步仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一步　兩步　徙</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khuann-khuann仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心情複雜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內leh滾絞--ê是……</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Íng過執行戒嚴格殺血令ê tsit-má</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Suah翻頭對in以前咬牙切齒ê死對頭phôo-phôo-thánn-thánn</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">錯亂　分bē清</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">現時是啥mih年代　又koh是啥mih款ê人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無是非之分　只有個人利益ê考慮</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Án-ne　hit-tsūn落獄受刑ê無辜被害者</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">又koh算啥　『處死刑可也』　短短五个字</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行出中正紀念堂　烏陰天　雨sap仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">分bē清</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">面容ê水滴　是雨　iah是</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">歷史ê目屎</span></p><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicRzhuNfvQrLjHSz4rE7C-AGivX0wBkqONhorsZkLI0tEBAX_5cuafLrBVMvwKXjDumnKQbovF-_VEJYRqwK2V1ZS3VhY5YhLh1BNbZ6ebELP7o3VSUPZJC3VxP7LAxaW3f8C4G0Vy9N8WNu8uymmnbBiE7XzBsDJ_bSMw9-2c7SpugdQkZ1r-xsCaUw/s1421/338%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicRzhuNfvQrLjHSz4rE7C-AGivX0wBkqONhorsZkLI0tEBAX_5cuafLrBVMvwKXjDumnKQbovF-_VEJYRqwK2V1ZS3VhY5YhLh1BNbZ6ebELP7o3VSUPZJC3VxP7LAxaW3f8C4G0Vy9N8WNu8uymmnbBiE7XzBsDJ_bSMw9-2c7SpugdQkZ1r-xsCaUw/w450-h640/338%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></span></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjtWO1K6ty1hl85nNg_3_gCTJH1lI2EzKGDPmMTtMCtY2BwC7b_ME-kuCWWySH